                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - PROLOGUE

Before the siege. The party is still only four, and the
woods are already dying.

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - THE GROVE

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The ancient grove shudders. A darkness creeps through the
roots, twisting all it touches.

The camera finds them — closer now.

A beat.

                      STUMPEY
                (scared)
          Big problems... we oughtta get outta
          here.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
          What is happening to the forest? I
          can feel it dying.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          Something has poisoned the
          heartwood. There is no curing this
          from here.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          Less talking, more running! North,
          through the old pass!

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Right. Stay close everyone. Move!

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY. REACH the old road north.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - THE GROVE - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      STUMPEY
                (whispering)
          We made it...

                      LADY
                (scared)
          But look behind us...

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          All those towers... everything we
          built. Gone.

A beat.

                      GOBLIN
          No use cryin' about it. What's
          ahead?

                      STUMPEY
          The old road. Nobody's used it in
          ages.

The party turns north, leaving the corrupted grove behind.

A beat.

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - THE RIDGE

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A beat.

The old road opens onto another clearing. The blight did not
follow — yet.

ANGLE ON STUMPEY.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          New dirt. Same feet. Keep moving.

A beat.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY. TAKE the north ridge.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - THE RIDGE - LATER

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      DOC
          Ridge is clear. Something still
          pulls north.

A beat.

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CLEAN GROUND

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A beat.

The ridge drops into a last hollow. The road ends in open
dirt.

ANGLE ON STUMPEY.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          That bright patch. That is the door.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Then we walk it. No more looking
          back.

A beat.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY. REACH the clean hollow.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ANCIENT GROVE - CLEAN GROUND - LATER

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      LADY
          The blight cannot reach us here.

A beat.

The party stands on clean ground. This road is done.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

# EPISODE 1

THE SIEGE.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - BREACH IN THE WALL

EPISODE 1: The Siege. CHAPTER 1.1 — Breach in the Wall.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The keep is burning. The outer wall has fallen and the enemy
pours through the breach.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          They're through the wall! Everybody
          up — we do not die here!

                      LADY
                (commanding)
          The gatehouse is gone. North, over
          the rubble!

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — The yard. Catch them if you still can. HOLD — Buy the
others time at the gap. RUN — The wall is lost. Run.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - BREACH IN THE WALL - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Out. Barely. Keep moving before they
          regroup.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - THE SALLY PORT

EPISODE 1: The Siege. CHAPTER 1.2 — The Sally Port.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A side passage clings to the inner wall — a forgotten sally
port, and a way out.

ANGLE ON DOC.

                      DOC
                (whispering)
          Guards ahead. We go quiet, or we do
          not go at all.

                      GOBLIN
          Quiet is not my strength.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

SNEAK — Stay out of the torchlight. HERE — Past the light.
Almost. RUN — The little door. Nobody watches it.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - THE SALLY PORT - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
          The door holds. We're outside the
          walls.

A beat.

