                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - COURTYARD GAUNTLET

EPISODE 1: The Siege. CHAPTER 1.3 — Courtyard Gauntlet.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The great courtyard is a killing floor. The enemy ram waits
at the far gate.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          That ram breaks the last gate if we
          let it. We don't let it.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — Catch your breath in the open yard. KILL — Wreck it
and the gate is ours.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - COURTYARD GAUNTLET - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
