                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - OVER THE MOAT

EPISODE 1: The Siege. CHAPTER 1.4 — Over the Moat.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The only way clear is the long bridge across the moat — and
the wagon of wounded must cross with you.

ANGLE ON LADY.

                      LADY
                (commanding)
          The wagon is slow and full of hurt.
          We do not leave it.

                      DOC
          Then we move together, or not at
          all.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — The boards hold. For now. GUARD — It cannot defend
itself — keep it whole. RUN — The far bank. Freedom, for
now.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE BURNING KEEP - OVER THE MOAT - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      STUMPEY
                (whispering)
          Across. The castle is behind us. All
          of it.

A beat.

