The camera finds them — closer now.

                      GOBLIN
                (scared)
          Is the ground supposed to be that
          colour?!

                      STUMPEY
                (shouting)
          Run. Explanations later. RUN.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — Do not stop. The road is melting. RUN — Do not stop.
The road is melting. GO — High ground. The flow can't
follow.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. ASHFALL - THE CINDER ROAD - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          The ridge holds. The fire pools
          below us.

