                                        FADE IN:

EXT. ASHFALL - EMBERHOLD

EPISODE 2: Ashfall. CHAPTER 2.2 — Emberhold.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A fortress of black stone squats on the caldera rim —
Emberhold, and the cultists who kept the fire.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      LADY
                (commanding)
          They feed the mountain from that
          keep. We take it.

