                                        FADE IN:

EXT. ASHFALL - THE CALDERA

EPISODE 2: Ashfall. CHAPTER 2.3 — The Caldera.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

Inside the caldera the air shimmers. A single vent breathes
the fire that fuels it all.

ANGLE ON DOC.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          Seal that vent and the eruption
          chokes. But it will fight us.

                      GOBLIN
          Everything fights us. Let's go.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

LAST — Stay alive while the vent overloads. KILL — Collapse
it and the mountain sleeps.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. ASHFALL - THE CALDERA - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
          It's closing. The roar is dying.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. ASHFALL - RIVERS OF FIRE

EPISODE 2: Ashfall. CHAPTER 2.4 — Rivers of Fire.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

Molten channels split the slope. Somewhere in the heat wait
the last living embers of the old faith.

ANGLE ON LADY.

                      LADY
                (commanding)
          Those coals are older than the
          kingdom. We carry them out.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — The sacred coals must not go cold. TAKE — The sacred
coals must not go cold. RUN — Off the mountain, embers and
all.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. ASHFALL - RIVERS OF FIRE - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      STUMPEY
          Embers safe. The mountain behind us.
          On to the cold.

A beat.

