# EPISODE 3

THE ICE WALL.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ICE WALL - FIRST FROST

EPISODE 3: The Ice Wall. CHAPTER 3.1 — First Frost.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A wall of blue ice runs to both horizons. Along its foot,
something is already hunting you.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      GOBLIN
                (whispering)
          Footprints. Not ours. Fresh.

                      DOC
                (whispering)
          We are the prey now. Move soft.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

SNEAK — Hunters walk the wall. Do not be seen. RUN — A
cleeward hollow. Warmth, and a moment.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ICE WALL - FIRST FROST - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
          Shelter. Rest — but not long.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ICE WALL - THE LONG CHASE

EPISODE 3: The Ice Wall. CHAPTER 3.2 — The Long Chase.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The wall never ends and neither does the chase. Wave after
wave breaks against your rear guard.

ANGLE ON GOBLIN.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          They just keep coming!

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Then we just keep running. Hold the
          back, get to the gap!

