                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE ICE WALL - CREVASSE

EPISODE 3: The Ice Wall. CHAPTER 3.3 — Crevasse.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

A crevasse splits the ice. One ledge, one failing bridge,
and hunters at your heels.

ANGLE ON LADY.

                      LADY
                (quietly, to himself)
          If we cut the bridge, they can't
          follow. But someone has to be last
          across.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Then we choose, and we choose fast.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

PICK — The narrow ledge, or cut the rope bridge behind you.
PICK — The narrow ledge, or cut the rope bridge behind you.
RUN — Across the crevasse, whatever it cost.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE ICE WALL - CREVASSE - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      DOC
                (whispering)
          The far rim. What's done is done.

