EXT. THE ICE WALL - THE BREAKING SHELF

EPISODE 3: The Ice Wall. CHAPTER 3.4 — The Breaking Shelf.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The whole shelf groans and begins to break apart. The exit
is the far edge — if it's still there when you arrive.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      GOBLIN
                (shouting)
          It's breaking! GO!

