EXT. THE MUSTER PLAIN - THE WAR CAMP

EPISODE 4: Muster. CHAPTER 4.1 — The War Camp.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

At last, allies. A war camp rises on the plain — but the
enemy would strangle it in the cradle.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          No more running. Here we build, and
          here we stand.

                      LADY
