and the camp stands.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE MUSTER PLAIN - THE WAR CAMP - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      GOBLIN
          Camp's holding. Feels strange,
          winning ground instead of losing it.

A beat.

