EXT. THE MUSTER PLAIN - THE ALLIANCE

EPISODE 4: Muster. CHAPTER 4.3 — The Alliance.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The hill clans hold the balance. Their banner would double
the muster — if they can be won.

ANGLE ON STUMPEY.

                      STUMPEY
                (quietly, to himself)
          We can ask for their banner. Or we
