EXT. THE MUSTER PLAIN - EVE OF BATTLE

EPISODE 4: Muster. CHAPTER 4.4 — Eve of Battle.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The last night before the march. The enemy tries one
desperate raid to break the muster before it moves.

The camera finds them — closer now.

                      DOC
                (quietly, to himself)
          They know what dawn brings. They'll
          spend everything tonight.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Then we spend the night killing
          raids. Hold the gate!

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HOLD — Keep the muster gate through the night. LAST — Last
till dawn and the army marches whole.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE MUSTER PLAIN - EVE OF BATTLE - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
