# EPISODE 5

CATACLYSM.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE LAST FIELD - THE BLACK TIDE

EPISODE 5: Cataclysm. CHAPTER 5.1 — The Black Tide.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The horizon is black with them. At its head walks a beast
the size of a keep.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      GOBLIN
                (scared)
          That is not an army. That is the end
          of the world.

                      STUMPEY
                (shouting)
          Then we end it first. For the beast
          — everyone, on me!

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — The horde comes in waves without end. HOLD — The
horde comes in waves without end. KILL — Kill the thing that
leads them and the tide breaks.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE LAST FIELD - THE BLACK TIDE - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      LADY
                (quietly, to himself)
          The beast falls. The tide falters —
          but only for a breath.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE LAST FIELD - THE SUNDERING

EPISODE 5: Cataclysm. CHAPTER 5.2 — The Sundering.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

The sky is tearing open. Three wards must hold while the
relic is carried to the wound in the world.

ANGLE ON DOC.

                      DOC
                (commanding)
          Hold the wards. Get the relic to the
          center. Everything depends on both.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HOLD — One of three anchors of the seal. HOLD — One of three
anchors of the seal. GUARD — Only the relic can close the
sundering.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE LAST FIELD - THE SUNDERING - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      STUMPEY
                (whispering)
          The relic's in place. The tear...
          it's slowing.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        FADE IN:

EXT. THE LAST FIELD - THE LAST LIGHT

EPISODE 5: Cataclysm. CHAPTER 5.3 — The Last Light.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

At the center of everything beats a dark heart. Around it,
the last of the light — and the last of you.

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      LADY
                (whispering)
          Whatever happens now, we finish it
          together.

                      STUMPEY
                (commanding)
          Together. For the heart. One last
          time.

                                        CUT TO:

PLAY.

HERE — Hold the ring while the light gathers. END — End it
here. There is no next road.

                                        CUT TO:

EXT. THE LAST FIELD - THE LAST LIGHT - LATER

The camera takes the field. Wide.

                      DOC
                (whispering)
          It's... over. The dark is gone.

The heart shatters into a thousand points of light, and the
world holds its breath — then breathes.

A beat.

                                        FADE OUT.

                                        THE END

